# Vendored upstream project (944 tracked files), not our code to format.
# It ships its own .prettierrc.yml, so formatting it with our rules would
# contradict its declared config and create a diff against upstream that has
# to be re-applied on every sync. Excluding it also removes the permanent
# floor of 2 that made 'prettier --check .' unable to ever exit 0.
external

